{"translation":{"id":"aii_abt","name":"ܕܝܬܩܐ ܚܕܬܐ ܕܡܪܢ ܝܫܘܥ ܡܫܝܚܐ ܘܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ ܒܠܫܢܐ ܐܬܘܪܝܐ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=aii","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=aii","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"ABT","englishName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic NT+Psalms","language":"aii","textDirection":"rtl","sha256":"1859152dbbffe55d2b7ac6d4c09fbad5a6416ca25359e69220bb358dac602444","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/books.json","numberOfBooks":28,"totalNumberOfChapters":410,"totalNumberOfVerses":10420,"languageName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic","languageEnglishName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"aii_abt","name":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","commonName":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","title":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"08b7c4463dda6adc56b2c377f42d67ace350af655720940a2e395776a718fc6c","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2461},"chapter":{"number":127,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["ܙܡܪܬ‌ܐ ܕܐܣܩܬ‌ܐ، ܒܝܕ ܫܠܝܡܘܢ."]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"ܐܸܢ ܡܵܪܝܵܐ ܠܵܐ ܒܵܢܹܐ ܒܲܝܬܵ‌ܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܣܪܝܼܩܵܐ ܝܠܹܗ ܥܲܡܠܵܐ ܕܒܲܢܵܝܘܼ̈ܗ‌ܝ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܸܢ ܡܵܪܝܵܐ ܠܵܐ ܢܵܛܹܪ ܡܕܝܼܢ݇ܬܵ‌ܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܣܪܝܼܩܬܵ‌ܐ ܝܠܵܗ̇ ܫܵܗܲܪܬܵ‌ܐ ܕܢܵܛܘܿܪܵܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܣܪܝܼܩܬܵ‌ܐ ܝܠܵܗ̇ ܐܸܠܵܘܟ݂ܘܿܢ ܕܩܲܕܡܝܼܬܘܿܢ ܠܸܩܝܵܡܵܐ، ܥܲܪܩܸܠܝܼܬܘܿܢ ܠܸܬܝܵܒ݂ܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܵܟ݂ܠܝܼܬܘܿܢ ܠܲܚܡܵܐ ܕܓ̰ܵܦܹ̈ܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܣܵܒܵܒ ܟܹܐ ܝܵܗܒܹܠܔ ܠܡܘܼܚܸܒܹܗ ܒܫܸܢܬܹܗ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܗܵܐ، ܝܵܪܬܘܼܬܵ‌ܐ ܡ̣ܢ ܡܵܪܝܵܐ ܒܢܘܿܢܹ̈ܐ ܝܢܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܦܘܼܪܥܵܢܵܐ ܝܠܵܗ̇ ܛܥܘܼܢܬܵ‌ܐ ܕܡܲܪܒܥܵܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܲܝܟ݂ ܓܹܐܪܹ̈ܐ ܓܵܘ ܐܝܼܕܵܐ ܕܓܲܒܵܪܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܗܵܕܟ݂ܵܐ ܝܢܵܐ ܒܢܘܿܢܹ̈ܐ ܕܫܸܢܹ̈ܐ ܕܥܠܲܝܡܘܼܬܵ‌ܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܛܘܼܒ݂ܵܐ ܠܓܲܒ݂ܪܵܐ ܕܡܠܹܐ ܠܹܗ ܚܸܠܬܹܗ ܡܸܢܵܝܗ‌ܝ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܠܹܐ ܢܵܟ݂ܦܝܼ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܟܲܕ ܗܲܡܙܸܡܝܼ ܥܲܡ ܕܸܫ̃ܡܸܢܹ̈ܐ ܒܕܲܪܘܵܙܵܐ.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/127.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/128.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/126.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":5}